From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ap: stage PSK files before publishing the accepted policy

Prepare both file inputs with the accepted inline key, without modifying the
live list or SAE PT ownership. Commit only after the complete pair succeeds;
share post-commit WPS policy and associated-PSK reconciliation with native reload.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---

